<li>BOOT.md, step 4 ("POSITIONS waits for his morning"); <code>postmortem-2026-09-19/held-list.md</code> line 17, the boot note of 10-12 16:34 (the consolidation for both files, "about 4M to 5M"; the writer works "from the rule texts as they stand in POSITIONS and the protocol"); <code>wc -c</code> on POSITIONS (102,874 bytes) and on FACTS at <code>49d78c8cd</code> (302,622); POSITIONS, "The Fable rule."</li>
