<li>POSITIONS, "The coordinator rewrite's goals." ("settled on evidence and a trial boot, not assumed"); <code>coordinator-shape.md</code> section 8, question 2; FACTS, the entry opening "A boot after a compaction costs about 285K tokens" (about 250K now); <code>coordinator-shape.md</code> section 2 (about 317K with the fixed part).</li>
