<li>POSITIONS, "The skills are written for a reader new to the repository ..." (the coordinator reviews the findings, the writer fixes them, then he reads); FACTS, "A headless <code>claude -p</code> session ... keeps its prompt cache for an hour" (44,900 read, 109 written).</li>
<li>POSITIONS, "The skills are written ..." (whole part, comments mark a problem area, the coordinator keeps the page in step), "Format." (the Select button); FACTS, the same headless entry (296,876 written).</li>
<li>POSITIONS, "The coordinator rewrite's goals." (the protocol retired, its worker rules to <code>fortress-repo</code>, the informal homes retired or folded in); <code>coordinator-shape.md</code> section 4.1, last group, and section 8, question 5; PLAN's last three rule sections (<code>PLAN.md:733</code>, <code>:750</code>, <code>:762</code>).</li>
<li>POSITIONS, "The order of the work after batch 10." (the <code>fortress-repo</code> method: "rewritten whole by the outline and the seven principles, every part cold-read and fixed"); <code>explorations/reviews/fortress-repo-outline.md</code>; <code>wc -c</code> on <code>.claude/skills/cloud-container/</code>; <code>coordinator-shape.md</code> section 3.4 (149K); <code>explorations/coordinator/PLAN.md</code>, "Where we stand", "Next" (batch 14 after both skills).</li>
